  requiredFlags: []
  blockedFlags: []
  speaker: 3
  text: 'The gate closes behind her. The sky over the school turns from black to
    grey to a thin, clean gold.


    On the pavement she opens the box: bookmark,
    paper, jasmine, note, programme, mug. Six small true things. She reads the lesson
    plans to the last page - the one line she has been climbing toward all night.


    At
    a first-floor window the Shadow stands like a student kept after class, and watches
    the light walk away without her.


    Knowledge is the only light that follows
    a person into the dark. Tonight it followed Nour all the way out.'
  localizationKeys:
  - FULL RECOVERY
  - Six pieces, every answer held. The box is full, and the morning lets her carry
    it.
